 "annotations": [
  {
   "id": "n-foundations",
   "page": "page-1",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -150,
   "w": 900,
   "text": "Corelith System v1 \u2014 approved 10 Sep 2026.\nEvery artboard inlines _kit.css verbatim, so a token changes in one place and the whole canvas follows.\nPages: Foundations \u00b7 Primitives \u00b7 Blocks \u00b7 Shells \u00b7 Campus."
  },
  {
   "id": "n-primitives",
   "page": "page-2",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -150,
   "w": 900,
   "text": "Identity is the headline change. 139 of the 216 mapped product surfaces render a person or an organisation; today Avatar is imported by 5 files out of 111."
  },
  {
   "id": "n-blocks",
   "page": "page-3",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -150,
   "w": 900,
   "text": "DomainBlocks carries the six ERP blocks the package does not have at all \u2014 line items, reconciliation, approval chain, audit trail, permission matrix, filter builder and saved views."
  },
  {
   "id": "n-shells",
   "page": "page-4",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -150,
   "w": 900,
   "text": "MobileShell, RegisterShell and DeviceSurfaces are locked to comfortable density: 44px targets for a till operator standing up, often on a resistive screen, sometimes on battery."
  },
  {
   "id": "n-campus",
   "page": "page-5",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -150,
   "w": 900,
   "text": "Corelith Campus \u2014 the school edition. One learner record from admission to leaving, read through five views: class list, register, mark sheet, fee statement and guardian portal."
  }
